1. Loads the scenario file
2. Registers MovementSystem
3. Creates entities
4. On render(), calls engine.update with fixed dt = 1/60
5. Counts ticks and exits after TICKS via Gdx.app.exit()

Then Main.java creates a HeadlessApplication and joins the thread.",
